    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n60093" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κρόκος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὁ
			</span>)ἡ, <i><span class="en">
			Str.
			14.5.5
		</span></i>), <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>saffron, Crocus
				sativus</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Il.
				14.348
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>h.Cer.</u>
				6
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hippon.
				41
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>OC</u>
				685
			</span></i> (lyr.), <i><span class="en">
				Cratin.
				98
			</span></i> (pl.), <i><span class="en">
				A.R.
				3.855
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Thphr.
				<u>HP</u>
				4.3.1
			</span></i>, al., <i><span class="en">
				Dsc.
				1.26
			</span></i>, etc. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense4"><b>b.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κ. λευκός</span>, <i>C. cancellatus</i>,
				<i><span class="en">
				Thphr.
				<u>HP</u>
				7.7.4
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense4"><b>c.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κ. ἀκανθώδης,</span>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κνῆκος</span>
			, ibid. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>saffron</i> (made from its stigmas), <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Nu.</u>
				51
			</span></i>, etc.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κρόκου βαφάς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.
					<u>Ag.</u>
					239
				</span></i>
			 (lyr.); <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κ. Ἀραβικός</span>
			<u>Edict.Diocl.</u>in 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ἀθηνᾶ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					18.6
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>saffron meadow</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Eust.
				1698.30
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>4.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σὺν κρόκῳ ᾠῶν</span>
			<i>yolk</i> of egg, <i><span class="en">
				Alex.Trall.
				1.1
			</span></i>: pl., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ᾠῶν τὰ κρόκα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Paul.Aeg.
					3.78
				</span></i>
			.</div>
